  "description": "My Workout Scheduler automates class reservations for recurring fitness sessions (e.g., BODYPUMP) across gyms (e.g., YMCA branches), ensuring accurate timing, branch validation, and preventing duplicate or erroneous bookings. It removes manual intervention by using structured guardrails to control when and how reservations occur.",
